1
00:04:05,714 --> 00:04:11,714
In revenge, patience is a virtue. And after a thousand years,
Colin MacLeod doesn't give a damn about virtue ...

2
00:08:11,428 --> 00:08:17,428
Highlander: The Search for Vengeance is a action, animation,
fantasy film directed by Yoshiaki Kawajiri.

3
00:12:17,142 --> 00:12:23,142
Colin MacLeod hunts for the man responsible for the death of his love.

4
00:16:22,857 --> 00:16:28,857
He chases the immortal Marcus Octavius across centuries as his
quest threatens to take over his life and heart.

5
00:20:28,571 --> 00:20:34,571
In his quest, he meets a woman who reminds him of his slain beauty.

6
00:24:34,285 --> 00:24:40,285
But it's his final battle with Marcus that will decide not only his
fate, but also the fate of everyone in the world.

7
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:46,000
Colin MacLeod (voice), played by Alistair Abell.

8
00:32:45,714 --> 00:32:51,714
Dahlia (voice), played by Debi Mae West.

9
00:36:51,428 --> 00:36:57,428
Marcus Octavius (voice), played by Nolan North.

10
00:40:57,142 --> 00:41:03,142
Amergan / Gregor / Lad Director (voice), played by Scott McNeil.

11
00:45:02,857 --> 00:45:08,857
Joe (voice), played by Ogie Banks.

12
00:49:08,571 --> 00:49:14,571
Kyala (voice), played by Janyse Jaud.

13
00:53:14,285 --> 00:53:20,285
Highlander: The Search for Vengeance is a 2007 adult animated dystopian fantasy
action film and an anime installment in the Highlander franchise.

14
00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:26,000
The film was directed by Yoshiaki Kawajiri (Ninja Scroll, Vampire Hunter D: Bloodlust) and was written by David
Abramowitz, also the writer for Highlander: The Series, Highlander: The Raven and Highlander: The Source.

15
01:01:25,714 --> 01:01:31,714
The film was a joint venture between Imagi Animation Studios and Madhouse Studio, with Imagi
providing the script and the soundtrack, while Madhouse produced the animation.

16
01:05:31,428 --> 01:05:37,428
It was produced in association with Davis-Panzer Productions and distributed by Manga
Entertainment on June 5, 2007 and aired on July 30 on Sci Fi's Ani-Monday block.

17
01:09:37,142 --> 01:09:43,142
The film is dedicated to the memory of William N.

18
01:13:42,857 --> 01:13:48,857
Panzer, who died in 2007, and was the co-owner of Davis-Panzer Productions.

19
01:17:48,571 --> 01:17:54,571
The film explores themes of future, new love, immortality, highlander, revenge.

20
01:21:54,285 --> 01:22:00,285
The tone is thought_provoking.
